ing same."}],"noNewGrammarReason":"Lexical-focus Lesson: same is practiced with familiar language."},"pedagogyVersion":2},"pilot":false,"audioRequired":true,"humanEnglishAuditRequired":true,"dialogueRuntime":"guided_exchange","qualityStage":"model_reviewed_for_testing"}')
